      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "seed": 1525,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1532,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Today the deploy scripts build each image on the VM (tar-ship source \u2192 docker build). Target CD: build once in CI, then pull the\nsame GHCR image by env tag \u2014 uat floats on latest/sha-*, prod pins the release version. The pattern extends to more envs (e.g. staging) via overlays/<env>.tfvars.",
      "originalText": "Today the deploy scripts build each image on the VM (tar-ship source \u2192 docker build). Target CD: build once in CI, then pull the\nsame GHCR image by env tag \u2014 uat floats on latest/sha-*, prod pins the release version. The pattern extends to more envs (e.g. staging) via overlays/<env>.tfvars.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
